{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>These are the heads of their fathers' houses.</b> Since it was necessary to trace the lineage of the tribe of Levi down to Moses and Aaron for the sake of Moses and Aaron, he began to trace their genealogy through their generations starting from Reuben. And in a major passage of Tanchuma I saw: because our father Jacob found fault with these three tribes at the time of his death, the verse went back and traced their lineage here by themselves, to declare that they are esteemed."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:46.641815315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}